ed}{y}_{1}=2 \\\\ 3{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this system is ${y}_{1}=2$ and ${y}_{2}=-9.$ \n\nTherefore, $y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063081/state.json" "file_sha256" "385e6f069156dc0f6f898e7f6f18862954ab6b167731863a03f1cd8b297536db"} {"question" "q-105755" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063081/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0a855bb07bf8dede1768bc415331b9700f0c7b9e0347f38a6be52438ac7df5f3"} {"question" "q-105755" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063081/state.json" "file_sha256" "385e6f069156dc0f6f898e7f6f18862954ab6b167731863a03f1cd8b297536db"} {"question" "q-105755" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "y=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "y=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063081/state.json" "file_sha256" "385e6f069156dc0f6f898e7f6f18862954ab6b167731863a03f1cd8b297536db"} {"question" "q-105755" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063081/state.json" "file_sha256" "385